384 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 788 0 R
/T (Information bottleneck. The compressed latent states must preserve enough detail \(numbers, entities, logical relationships\) for the downstream language model to produce a correct answer. If the predictor's dimensionality is too aggressive, critical information is lost silently.)
/E (Information bottleneck. The compressed latent states must preserve enough detail \(numbers, entities, logical relationships\) for the downstream language model to produce a correct answer. If the predictor's dimensionality is too aggressive, critical information is lost silently.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
