385 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 789 0 R
/T (Parameter overhead vs. KV-cache savings. The JEPA module adds parameters and compute that wouldn't exist in a standard CoT pipeline. The net win depends on whether the reduced KV-cache pressure in the primary LLM outweighs the cost of running the predictor )
/E (Parameter overhead vs. KV-cache savings. The JEPA module adds parameters and compute that wouldn't exist in a standard CoT pipeline. The net win depends on whether the reduced KV-cache pressure in the primary LLM outweighs the cost of running the predictor )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
