/Title (Canonicalized chain-of-thought traces. Real CoT interleaves genuine steps with meta-thoughts \("Okay, let me try to figure this out", "Hmm, maybe I should check this again"\), self-corrections, and restatements. We rewrite each trace offline into clean, numbered logical steps before encoding so the predictor learns logic transitions rather than narration artifacts, and the position-derived halt labels stay clean. \(addressing challenge #4\))
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1056 0 R
/Next 979 0 R
>>
