/Title (Joint Embedding Predictive Architecture \(JEPA\) has recently showed interesting results being able to predict directly in latent space rather than pixel/token space, avoiding the wasteful step of reconstructing raw inputs.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1059 0 R
