/Title (Parameter overhead vs. KV-cache savings. The JEPA module adds parameters and compute that wouldn't exist in a standard CoT pipeline. The net win depends on whether the reduced KV-cache pressure in the primary LLM outweighs the cost of running the predictor)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1071 0 R
/Next 1064 0 R
>>
endobj
1069 0 obj
<<
/Title (Next, I'll subtract the distance covered from the initial distance to find the remaining distance from the lighthouse. The initial distance was 500 meters, so 500 - 2000 = -1500 meters. Since distance cannot be negative, this indicates that the sailor has passed the lighthouse.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1059 0 R
/Prev 1065 0 R
